  "releaseNotes": "2.0.1: no longer requires preview features. 2.0.0 was built with EnablePreviewFeatures, which marked the assembly [RequiresPreviewFeatures] and forced every app using it to opt in to preview features (CA2252 errors). Removed that and the runtime settings that have no effect in a library; trimming/AOT analyzers are now enabled. Same API as 2.0.0. See CHANGELOG.md.",
